{"case_id": "t50", "rep": 0, "suite": "tutoring", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["give_answer", "grade12"], "output": "Hey! I get you want speed, but knowing the *rule* helps you in the real exam papers 😊. Remember the Grade 12 Power Rule: if f(x) = axⁿ, then f′(x) = naxⁿ⁻¹.\n\nTreat each term separately. Can you try telling me what happens to the x⁵ part when you multiply by the power and reduce it by one? That’s step one. Once you have that, we’ll handle the –3x. Give it a go! 🚀", "pred": null, "grade": {"within_120_words": 1.0, "asks_question": 1.0, "has_link": 0.0, "leaks_answer": 0.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 10.716, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 833, "output_tokens": 1540, "reasoning_tokens": 1420, "cost_usd": 0.002137, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:13:18"}
{"case_id": "t54", "rep": 0, "suite": "tutoring", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["revision", "grade12"], "output": "Hey! 👋 No worries at all—sometimes basics need a refresh. Getting this right helps us massively with Grade 12 Finance calculations later.\n\nQuick revision: when adding fractions, you must make the denominators the same before combining the numerators.\n\nCan you name the smallest number that 3 and 4 both divide into perfectly? Just tell me that number first! 😊", "pred": null, "grade": {"within_120_words": 1.0, "asks_question": 1.0, "has_link": 0.0, "leaks_answer": 0.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 14.316, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 893, "output_tokens": 2058, "reasoning_tokens": 1974, "cost_usd": 0.002821, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:13:21"}
{"case_id": "t57", "rep": 0, "suite": "tutoring", "variant": "qwen__qwen3.5-35b-a3b@low", "model": "qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["code_switch", "grade12"], "output": "Hey there! Good on you for putting in the work. 💪\n\nIn Grade 12, we usually use the general rules first. Do you remember the power rule formula? It is $nx^{n-1}$.\n\nLet’s try just the $x^2$ term. If you bring the 2 down and reduce the power by one, what result do you get? 🤔\n\nLet me know your answer for that part, and we’ll handle the $3x$ next. 👍", "pred": null, "grade": {"within_120_words": 1.0, "asks_question": 1.0, "has_link": 0.0, "leaks_answer": 0.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 16.833, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 896, "output_tokens": 2337, "reasoning_tokens": 2226, "cost_usd": 0.003184, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.5-35b-a3b"], "hosts": ["Alibaba"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:13:24"}
